{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-372",
  "title": "Init",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Init"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Below is a “storyboard‐level” concept you could hand to a designer-developer pair (or build yourself in Nuxt 3 + GSAP / Lenis) to create a New York Times-style scrollytelling page that sells the spirit of BYI’s new **Affinity Tours** and nudges visitors to register."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Hero “Scroll-In” Moment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Element | Idea | Interaction |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Full-bleed video** | A slow-motion close-up of Brother Eric’s hands planting a seedling in South Baltimore soil. | The video is fixed; as the user scrolls the title **“Keep the Flame.”** fades in, followed by a subtitle **“Affinity Tours, BYI • Year 10”** that drops in with slight parallax (moves at ~0.8 × scroll speed). |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Ambient sound opt-in** | Soft urban garden ambience (birds, distant traffic) triggered by a small speaker icon (off by default for accessibility). | Hover reveals “sound on/off.” |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Section: “Why Affinity Tours?” (Pinned Narrative)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Pinned text column (left 40%)** explaining the purpose of tours."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Scrolling media column (right 60%)** cycles through:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Archival photo of BYI’s first harvest"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Short clip of a community workshop"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Statistic overlay (e.g., “150+ community gardeners trained”)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each asset fades in/out as the page scrolls (GSAP timeline)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Subtle background color shift** from deep earth brown → warm maize to mirror growth."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Interactive “Four Initiative Areas” Grid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Initiative | Visual | Micro-interaction |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Food Sovereignty** | Illustrated map of local food system nodes that animates when in view. | Hover highlights each node; click opens a 12-word description inline. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Community Education** | Chalk-style doodles morph into real-life class photos. | On scroll, doodles erase and photo appears (SVG mask). |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Land Justice** | Parallax aerial photo of South Baltimore with animated boundary lines. | Scroll reveals before/after overlays. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Cooperative Economics** | Animated coin icons that stack to form a small greenhouse. | Scroll upward collapses stack, reinforcing investment concept. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*Implementation hint:* Build as a Nuxt **route-level component** with `<client-only>` GSAP animations to avoid SSR mismatch."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. “Choose Your Experience” Timeline (Horizontal Scrub)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A horizontal scrub section (Lenis or Locomotive Scroll) listing tour dates **every 4th Friday, July – Dec**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Each date card expands on scroll to show:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Time slots (Full-day vs. 90-min)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Max seats left (live via Supabase or Airtable API)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Quick-register button"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The background image shifts from summer greens to winter ochres as the scrub moves, subtly indicating seasonal change."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Immersive “Day-in-the-Life” Parallax Stack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Stack five full-width images that peel away on scroll, giving a taste of a full-day tour:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Sunrise gathering at the farm"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Morning workshop"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Communal lunch"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Afternoon service task"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Evening reflection circle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each layer moves at different speeds; subtle caption appears on each."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Testimonial Pull-Quotes (Scroll-Triggered)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Quotes appear in large serif type, pinned center, with blurred background footage."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As the user scrolls, quote swaps out with 3D “page turn” effect; next quote slides in."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Accessibility note: Provide `aria-live` region and alt text for motion-reduced users (offer “Jump to Transcript”)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. Donation + Membership “Upsell”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Fixed dark overlay slides up when user reaches 80% of page:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> “Loved what you saw? Become a BYI donor-member and keep the flame alive.”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Two contrasted CTAs: **Sign Up for Tour** (primary) vs. **Donate & Join** (secondary but visible)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Slight wobble animation if scroll idle for 6 s (draws eye without feeling spammy)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "8. Closing “Flame” Animation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Animated SVG torch where the flame is drawn by scroll; final flame steadies when user reaches end."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Final call: **“Will you join us?”**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-63",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Social sharing buttons fade in sequentially."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Design System & Tech Stack Pointers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Need | Suggestion |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Visual Style** | Earth-tone palette (#4B3621 brown, #F2C066 maize, #EDEADE light cream) with bold hand-drawn accents that echo BYI grassroots vibe. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Typography** | Headings in a sturdy slab serif (e.g., *Arvo*), body in clean sans (e.g., *Inter*). |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Framework** | Nuxt 3 + Nuxt Content for MD-driven sections; GSAP ScrollTrigger for parallax/pinning; Lenis for smooth scrolling. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Performance** | Use `v-lazy` images with `srcset`; defer auto-playing videos; provide `prefers-reduced-motion` CSS fallback. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Accessibility** | Ensure semantic HTML, high contrast, alt text, keyboard-navigable CTAs, and motion-reduced mode. |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How This Serves Autumn-Style Outreach"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Story-first design** models the nonprofit-friendly storytelling Autumn promises."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-77",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**MD-driven content + component library** means BYI staff could update copy/images via the CMS without dev help."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-78",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Reusable blocks** (timeline scrub, initiative grid) become standard Autumn components for other nonprofits—strengthening Autumn’s template library and sales demos."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*Hope this sparks some visuals!* Let me know if you’d like wireframes, GSAP snippets, or advice on integrating this into your Nuxt/Tailwind stack."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}